 * A link that opens in a new tab, with the arrow and screen-reader hint Markdown links get.
 *
 * File Structure:
 * - Props: every anchor attribute
 * - Text split so the arrow never starts a line
 *
 * Where this file is used within the repository:
 * - Data pages and project components
